<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Utilize advanced brewing techniques that allow distillation and fermenting of harder spirits with unique effects.-->
  <VBE_LiquorBrewing.description>允许用蒸馏法酿造度数更高的烈酒。</VBE_LiquorBrewing.description>
  <VBE_LiquorBrewing.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the symphony of flavors-->
    <li>subject-&gt;炼酒术</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->mastered the electric alchemy of mixology, blending science and art to stir the soul with every sip-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;复苏了古代的蒸馏之法，将酒精炼成能一口暖和全身的神奇饮料</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->introduced an era of sophistication in drink, where the bar becomes a stage for the dance of flavors-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;让酿酒从简单的发酵变成了一门复杂的手艺，创造出口味无比深邃的酒饮</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered machines for perfect fermenting and bottling, ensuring each concoction is a masterpiece-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开发出了工匠精神的最后遗产，每一滴酒都诉说了它的故事</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->pioneered the creation of cocktails that are not merely drinks, but experiences, evoking moments and memories-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;将酒的精华呈现在你的面前</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->crafting elixirs that captivate the senses, blending tradition with innovation at the bar workbench-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;在酒吧工作台上打造令人着迷的灵丹妙药，将传统与创新融为一体</li>
  </VBE_LiquorBrewing.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: liquor brewing-->
  <VBE_LiquorBrewing.label>烈酒酿造</VBE_LiquorBrewing.label>
  <!--EN: Allows construction of advanced machines that utilize electricity for perfect fermenting, industrial bottling, and the mixing of cocktails at the bar workbench.-->
  <VBE_MixologyResearch.description>更先进的知识酿酒，可以使用工业机器蒸馏和装瓶饮料。允许调酒台来调配鸡尾酒。</VBE_MixologyResearch.description>
  <VBE_MixologyResearch.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the alchemy of spirits-->
    <li>subject-&gt;酒香的共鸣</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->harnessed the ancient secrets of distillation, refining the craft to produce spirits that warm the soul and embolden the heart-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;研发出了调酒的技术，将科学与艺术的结晶浓缩成杯中的一小口</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->elevated brewing from simple fermentation to an art form, creating liquors with unparalleled depth and character-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;让饮料不再单调，让吧台变成舞台</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->cultivated a legacy of craftsmanship, where each drop tells the story of its making-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;造出了一台机器，专门用来调酒装瓶，让每一杯都成为独一无二的杰作</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->distilling the essence of tradition into spirits of distinction-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;成为了鸡尾酒的先驱，做出的不仅是酒，更是生活的酸甜苦辣</li>
  </VBE_MixologyResearch.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: mixology-->
  <VBE_MixologyResearch.label>调酒</VBE_MixologyResearch.label>
</LanguageData>
